This product depends on the following third-party crates (non-exhaustive):

  fastcdc (MIT/Apache-2.0)   — Content-defined chunking
  zstd (MIT)                 — Zstandard compression (binding to C library)
  blake3 (CC0-1.0/Apache-2.0)— BLAKE3 hash function
  lz4_flex (MIT)             — Pure-Rust LZ4 compression
  divsufsort (MIT)           — Pure-Rust suffix array construction
  byteorder (MIT/Unlicense)  — Little-endian serialization
  thiserror (MIT/Apache-2.0) — Error type derivation
  clap (MIT/Apache-2.0)      — CLI argument parsing
  rayon (MIT/Apache-2.0)     — Data parallelism
  crc32fast (MIT/Apache-2.0) — CRC32 checksums
  serde (MIT/Apache-2.0)     — Serialization framework
  tracing (MIT)              — Structured logging
  axum (MIT)                 — HTTP server framework (aether-server)
  tokio (MIT)                — Async runtime (aether-server)
  aes-gcm (MIT/Apache-2.0)   — AES-256-GCM encryption
  chacha20poly1305 (MIT/Apache-2.0) — ChaCha20-Poly1305 encryption
  argon2 (MIT/Apache-2.0)    — Argon2id key derivation
  wasm-bindgen (MIT/Apache-2.0) — WebAssembly bindings (aether-wasm)

